### Reject an interproximal-reduction entry without the required amount
POST http://localhost:8080/fhir/CarePlan/$validate?profile=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/StructureDefinition/aligner-care-plan
Authorization: Basic basic:secret
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "CarePlan",
